transfer falls within an exception in Rule 501(a)
=================================================

4 ways this can be satisfied.

  1. (1) transfer's to the issuer of the securities
  2. (2) transfer's to an accredited investor
  3. (3) transfer's as part of an offering registered with the Commission
  4. (4) (a)(4) — a family or trust transferee, or a death-or-divorce circumstance OF transfer
